WEBVTT

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:47.090
At my grandfather's retirement home,

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:52.420
I came in touch with books of heroic epics gathered from all over the world.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:57.220
Although there were many books I could not understand,

00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:01.470
I was dragged deeper and deeper into these heroic epics,

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:06.180
for I knew heroes really existed.

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:11.370
The hero that I had the most respect for,

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:14.300
with a gentle yet sad expression,

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.940
left me with a message.

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:34.000
I bet you're thinking about work again.

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:38.010
No.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:58.530
I will be wed.

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:07.420
Are you really getting married?

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.120
I am only leaving for a few days.

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:13.390
Oreld, I name you acting-commander during this time period.

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:27.870
Alice.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.060
Alice!

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.670
I knew you were thinking about work!

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:35.760
No.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:39.060
Make sure you get to speak about your engagement with Lord Leonir tonight.

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.970
For all the delays you've caused the process,

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:44.600
you will have to start making up for them tonight.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.120
I will.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:50.330
I am here tonight to resume the talks.

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:21.730
Big guy.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:25.070
Hey, big guy!

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:26.240
Y-Yes, sir!

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.110
Quit daydreaming.

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:29.790
I'm done peeling the skin off of these potatoes.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:31.630
F-Forgive me.

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:50.090
Master Sergeant, here you go.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:53.190
Wow...

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:55.530
Oreld is skilled...

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:02.910
Maybe the LT's news was really a shock for him?

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:07.240
It's not like she's getting married today or tomorrow.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:10.110
This is just a guess,

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:13.120
but maybe he liked the LT.

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:16.800
Who knows.

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:19.960
I think it's a bit different.

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:29.160
Corporal, could you hold me up a bit?

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:30.670
O-Okay...

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:34.360
It's hot!! The steam!

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:38.910
We don't have to worry too much, either, if he really does have a crush on her.

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:44.500
In his case, though, I figure it must be some kind of irreplaceable feeling.

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:46.840
Don't cut!

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:48.500
What'd you say, punk?!

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:50.830
I said, don't cut!

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:53.790
You quit lining up over and over again!

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:56.040
All right, all right, enough.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.560
Don't be fighting over stupid reasons.

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:00.470
We're all mature grown-ups.

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:02.140
Get lost, soldier!

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:03.790
You guys sure have it good!

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:05.790
You get to eat good stuff every day!

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.760
You're no different than those people up there!

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:13.970
I heard they're throwing a ballroom party tonight,

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:15.660
wearing nice clothing,

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:16.610
eating good food,

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:17.480
drinking good wine...

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:20.690
...as if they're showing off to us while we line up for rations...

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:31.240
That will piss people off.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:32.550
What do you have to say?!

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.370
Huh, yo!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.140
God, don't say this stuff to me.

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:39.330
How about you all go complain to them personally right now?

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:42.460
Nah...

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:45.140
We won't go that far...

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:46.290
Y-Yeah...

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:48.780
Sorry for losing our temper...

00:06:51.850 --> 00:06:55.010
What's with that reaction?

00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:58.500
Did it go well?

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.600
Well, yeah.

00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:01.370
Sorry...

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:03.900
We're usually set up in a different park,

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:07.460
but our superiors suddenly gave orders to change locations.

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:13.640
It's really just a bad coincidence for the ration distribution and the ballroom party to be on the same night...

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:17.730
No, the fault belongs to us soldiers.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:20.660
We can't do anything else but give supplies...

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.810
...to you people that are working hard in social welfare organizations.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.330
Oh, don't say that.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:26.520
You're even helping us peel potatoes,

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:29.620
and you're very good at it.

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:34.490
I've peeled tens of thousands of them inside the stockade.

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:41.000
I wonder if the LT's arrived already.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.450
Dearest Alice!

00:07:57.900 --> 00:07:59.510
Lord Schultz.

00:07:59.510 --> 00:08:01.450
I have been waiting for you!

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:05.220
Has Lord Leonir arrived yet?

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.530
I'm not sure.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:08.820
I haven't met him yet.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.170
I see.

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:13.250
Ah, please accept these-

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:16.530
Alice...

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:20.690
Alice sure isn't being sociable.

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:24.020
You should make a decision soon, eh?

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:25.730
Decision?

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:34.610
It's the three princesses of the Malvin family.

00:08:35.540 --> 00:08:37.820
I heard the two elder ones have already married.

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:42.630
No, the families they married still allow them to carry the Malvin name.

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:46.700
Ah, to emphasize that they've become relatives of the Thirteen Appointed Families.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:51.180
So, is that third princess becoming the next head of the family?

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:54.340
No, actually, there's some interesting rumors going around.

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:58.600
This atmosphere makes me angry every time.

00:08:58.860 --> 00:09:00.460
It's only in the beginning.

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:01.600
It'll calm down right away.

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:12.550
Shall I bring you some food?

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:13.860
No, I shall be fine.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:17.740
Where have you left behind your heart?

00:09:19.230 --> 00:09:20.950
Whenever you come to these places,

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:24.450
you always let out a protesting sigh.

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:26.910
Have you ever noticed?

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:31.940
You have never smiled in front of me, Alice.

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:33.650
That isn't-

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:39.550
I've always been wondering who are the people you would smile at.

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:42.610
Would it be Lord Leonir?

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:44.380
No, that's not correct.

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:46.220
And that's when it came to me.

00:09:46.970 --> 00:09:50.420
You always leave your heart in Section III.

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:51.350
I-

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:54.110
Let me tell you honestly.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.730
I am jealous of Section III.

00:09:58.190 --> 00:10:00.500
Right now, as you look at these dishes,

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:03.210
you have Section III in your mind, right?

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:11.320
Why if it isn't the famous three princesses of the Malvin family?

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:14.690
You two, I'll be fine here.

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:19.040
It sure is rare to see all three princesses in dresses together.

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:23.040
Who's this old fart?

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:24.110
Marquis Paul.

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:28.410
The director of our country's Economic Development Branch.

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.690
Schultz, long time no see.

00:10:33.690 --> 00:10:34.730
I am humbled.

00:10:36.470 --> 00:10:38.320
Oh, pardon me, pardon me.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:40.580
If you'd forgive me, Schultz.

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:44.080
My, my, the pizza tonight sure is excellent.

00:10:47.400 --> 00:10:49.870
Please forgive my disrespect.

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:54.070
This is my first time meeting with the next head of the Malvin family.

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:55.680
Well met.

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:56.580
Yes.

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:05.850
I've caught you, my princess.

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:07.970
Lord Leonir.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.080
Look, it's Leonir Taylor!

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:34.260
I've heard he has created three extremely successful businesses this year!

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:37.190
He's handsome and he's successful at work! How wonderful!

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:39.380
He surely is the young lion of the financial world.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:41.000
This is so vexing!

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.080
Why does a little girl like her get to have him?

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:45.240
Ah, but that rumor-

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:47.760
We may have a chance now, too!

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:50.050
My princess.

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:53.850
How about we have some champagne over there?

00:11:58.060 --> 00:11:59.330
Be strong.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:01.190
Give us a report afterwards.

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:03.690
Alice...

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:05.620
Do pardon us, Schultz.

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:17.630
Lord Leonir.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.050
What is it, Princess?

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:23.160
You have heard the rumors, right?

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:29.600
I will soon no longer be the princess you are thinking of.

00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:33.000
I, Alice L. Malvin,

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:38.150
will likely be stripped of my title as the next head of the family in a few years.

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:42.610
The rumors of your baby brother are true then?

00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:44.690
While he has not been introduced to the public yet,

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:46.610
he is already five years old now.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.660
Ever since my current mother gave birth to my brother,

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:54.090
Father seems to have made up his mind.

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:59.130
If my brother should become the head of the family, the Malvin family would no longer need to take in grooms.

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:04.170
Neither would the Taylor family reap any benefits for taking me in.

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:09.380
Right now, it wouldn't tarnish the reputation of the Taylor family.

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:12.630
This is my own judgment, but-

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:14.680
You want to annul our engagement?

00:13:15.090 --> 00:13:16.710
How arrogant of you.

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:19.290
Is this how the Thirteen Appointed Families are like?

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:20.180
Yes.

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:21.960
This is how the Thirteen Appointed Families are like.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.900
I am shocked,

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.330
not at the arrogant way you talk,

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:31.640
not at the way you speak lovingly of a brother that you should be hating,

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:35.160
not at the way you alone would bear all the ensuing disgrace,

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:41.870
but I am shocked as a gentleman that you do not appear to even feel sorry for our engagement.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:43.870
Ahh... no...

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:46.550
You are a very charming man, Lord Leonir.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:49.050
That's all right.

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.570
Let us stop this questioning.

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:56.600
However, answer me one thing please.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:01.560
Even as you know your brother will become the head of the family,

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:06.770
why have you been able to maintain your fervor as the next head of the family?

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:09.370
There's no special reason;

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.960
because I am the next head of the family right now.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:16.170
No, but you will lose that title in a few years, right?

00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:21.730
I'm not sure I understand what you're asking.

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:26.380
If there's no meaning to something that'll eventually be lost,

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:29.120
then there's no meaning to your life either, right?

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.980
Whether it's because of time, illness, or the blade,

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:35.270
your life will eventually be taken.

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.550
Then, will you take your life now?

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:40.210
It's the same thing.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:45.830
You sure are...

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:48.210
You sure are unique!

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:52.580
Forget about annulling our engagement!

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:55.900
I have made up my mind that I will not let anyone else have you.

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:57.000
My princess.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.760
Umm, I cannot drink alcohol-

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:03.250
I would like to look after you.

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.900
They seem to be having quite some fun.

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:12.440
But she is not smiling.

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:15.260
What?!!

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:17.840
Marquis Paul...

00:15:21.990 --> 00:15:24.170
What happened, Marquis Paul?

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:26.370
What do you think?!

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:29.290
I was asking for the recipe of this canape since it was so delicious,

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:32.250
but he said it uses a paste made from acorn!

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:33.670
Acorn!!

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:35.860
We're lacking in supplies, so...

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:38.870
And we made sure we processed and prepared it well-

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:44.690
Acorn is what animals eat!

00:15:44.690 --> 00:15:46.030
It's acorn...

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:49.320
Oh gosh, didn't you say it tasted delicious when you had some earlier?

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:50.670
You said it, too!

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:58.460
Don't think you can ever work inside the capital again!

00:15:58.460 --> 00:15:59.930
B-But...

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:15.380
This tastes wonderful.

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:17.570
Very well, I'll hire you.

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:23.720
You stupid girl!!

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:26.560
Don't pick things off the ground and eat them...

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:28.190
But Sisters,

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:33.150
this canape is a nice dish that the chef prepared under lack of supplies-

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:35.760
The canape may be nice, but the floor's dirty!

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:38.890
Even so, you didn't need to hit me like that.

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:43.150
Alice.

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:52.900
What is it, Lord Schultz?

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.050
That was a wonderful smile from you.

00:16:56.520 --> 00:16:58.990
It was really natural and lovely.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.310
Lord Schultz?

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:04.900
You have no idea how much that chef has been saved by your words and your smile.

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:10.130
I now understand somewhat the meaning to Section III's job.

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:15.030
I want to know even more about what you aim for.

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:18.430
To achieve that, I shall leave you for a while.

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:34.080
I thank you, dearest Alice.

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.250
Lord Schultz...

00:17:41.070 --> 00:17:42.980
Section III...

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:44.580
Alice L. Malvin...

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:50.050
What exactly have you seen in this cold and harsh world?

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:22.670
Done and done.

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:23.880
A job well done.

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:28.710
Big guy, tell the kiddo to start packing up, too.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:29.480
Yes, sir.

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:39.180
It's only a small part of the whole picture,

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:41.840
but this is the war relief you've accomplished.

00:18:46.110 --> 00:18:48.360
You're not going to eat, Mom?

00:18:48.360 --> 00:18:51.260
Mom is already full.

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:53.200
So, eat my part.

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:53.730
Okay!

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:01.840
The frostbite hurts.

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:13.340
Mom, look, look!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:14.890
That's great, isn't it?

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:16.260
Thank you very much.

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:19.170
Thanks, Mr. Soldier!

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:22.680
Okay!

00:19:32.160 --> 00:19:35.150
There's nothing left for Mer-kun.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:36.640
Master Sergeant...

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:40.680
What should I do?

00:19:43.790 --> 00:19:45.990
You shouldn't do that, Corporal.

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:49.410
I understand how you feel, but...

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:53.920
Here, done!

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.420
Thanks!!

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.320
I'm sorry.

00:20:00.320 --> 00:20:03.260
Next time, you won't even have a coat to wear.

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:07.420
Of course, that feeling is very important.

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:12.820
I've made the same mistake many times already,

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:14.900
but whenever we give out rations,

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:18.440
I always give too much to the poor children.

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:20.930
So, Corporal, you should-

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:22.610
Huh?

00:20:25.940 --> 00:20:28.250
What am I doing?

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:32.020
Am I expecting something to happen?

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:33.970
Do I want to achieve something?

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:37.710
"I can accomplish many things"...

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:44.310
To be able to say, "I can accomplish many things," when the 2nd Lieutenant eventually leaves Section III...

00:20:56.090 --> 00:20:59.220
Oh, there's no way something could-

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:06.930
Men!

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:09.240
Are you done eating your last supper?

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:10.290
Yeah!

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:13.320
We've made up our minds when we saw the lights of that ballroom party!

00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:14.620
We can't let this go on!

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:18.470
I have in my hands documents that comrades have sent me!

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:22.240
Documents that are evidence of embezzlement by Director of the Economic Development Branch, Marquis Paul!

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:25.890
By dawn tomorrow, every media agency will have received a copy of it.

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:29.040
But that by itself is not enough!

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:31.580
There needs to be one more blow!

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:33.610
Why not let us deliver that blow?

00:21:34.210 --> 00:21:36.060
I need to report this to the Sergeant Majors...

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:39.770
We will most definitely be arrested and executed.

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:41.370
But one more blow!

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:51.120
One more blow...

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:54.360
...against Paul and those nobles!

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:34.140
Mer-kun, the evil plotters are finally making their moves.

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:36.270
Yet, I have to sit in the office on this snowy night.

00:23:36.270 --> 00:23:39.390
Hurry and go save Alice, Corporal!

00:23:39.700 --> 00:23:41.670
Next time, "Enter the Performers."

